  "settings.restoreWarnTitle": "Ngenisa ugcino?",
  "settings.restoreWarnBody": "Ngenisa uhlaziyo lwentengiselwano kunye nohlahlo lwabiwo-mali kuphela kuluhlu lomhla kwifayile. Idatha engaphandle koluhlu kule fowuni ihlala. \n\nIiakhawunti: zibuyiselwa kwifayile kuphela ukuba le fowuni ayinazo zezentengiselwano okwangoku (umzekelo emva kokufakwa kwakhona). Kungenjalo iiakhawunti zakho zangoku zihlala. \n\nUya kubuzwa ukuba uthathe indawo yezikhumbuzo kunye noluhlu lokuthenga. \n\nUkuba ungqamaniso lwamafu ePrimiyamu luvuliwe, iziphumo ezidityanisiweyo ziyangqinelaniswa (eyokugqibela ~ iminyaka emi-2 efini).",
